@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10

actor User
participant "AssistantView" as UI
participant "HighlightModal" as Modal
participant "ZoteroService" as ZoteroSvc
participant "ObsidianService" as ObsSvc
database "Zotero App\n(Better BibTeX)" as Zotero
database "Obsidian Vault" as Vault

== Initialization ==
User -> UI: Clicks "Review Highlights"
UI -> Modal: open(citationKey)
activate Modal

== Data Fetching ==
Modal -> UI: Show Loading State
Modal -> ZoteroSvc: getAnnotations(citationKey)
activate ZoteroSvc

ZoteroSvc -> Zotero: HTTP POST (JSON-RPC)
note right: Retrieves item data & children
Zotero --> ZoteroSvc: JSON Response
ZoteroSvc -> ZoteroSvc: Parse & Normalize Data
ZoteroSvc --> Modal: ZoteroAnnotation[]
deactivate ZoteroSvc

== Processing & Linking ==
loop For each Annotation
    Modal -> ObsSvc: findLocalImage(annotation)
    ObsSvc -> Vault: Check for matching image file
    Vault --> ObsSvc: File path or null

    Modal -> ObsSvc: isAnnotationExported(key)
    ObsSvc -> Vault: Check for existing Note
    Vault --> ObsSvc: TFile or null
end

== Rendering ==
Modal -> Modal: Sort Annotations\n(by Color/Page/Date)
Modal -> Modal: Render Cards to DOM
Modal --> User: Display Interactive Modal

== Actions ==
opt Create Note
    User -> Modal: Click "Create Note"
    Modal -> ObsSvc: saveNote(annotation)
    ObsSvc -> Vault: Write Markdown File
end

deactivate Modal
@enduml
